    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "NO. 50 USHNAGH COURT, LYNN ROAD, MULLINGAR, CO. WESTMEATH, N91 AE38\r\n\r\nModern 3 Bedroom Duplex Apartment in a Highly Sought-After Location\r\n3 Bedrooms (1 Ensuite) • Kitchen • Living/Dining Room • Bathroom\r\nPVC Double Glazing • Electric Central Heating • Secure Gated Development\r\nDesignated Parking • B Energy Rating • Excellent Town Centre Location\r\n\r\nPRICE: €269,950\r\n\r\nSituated within the popular and well-maintained development of Ushnagh Court, this spacious three-bedroom duplex apartment offers modern, low-maintenance living in a secure gated complex just minutes from Mullingar Town Centre.\r\n\r\nNo. 50 Ushnagh Court extends over two floors, providing bright and generously proportioned accommodation. The property benefits from a spacious living room, fitted kitchen, three well-appointed bedrooms including a master ensuite, family bathroom, designated parking and a highly convenient location within walking distance of shops, schools, the train station and all local amenities.\r\n\r\nWith a strong B BER rating, the property qualifies for Green Mortgage products and represents an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers, investors or those seeking a secure and convenient town-centre residence.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch\r\n2.45m x 1.77m\r\n•\tTiled floor \r\n•\tElectric heater\r\n \r\nHallway\r\n3.36m x 1.07m\r\n•\tTimber flooring \r\nLiving Room\r\n\r\n5.66m x 3.51m\r\n•\tSpacious reception room \r\n•\tFitted carpet \r\n•\tTV point \r\n•\tBright and comfortable living space \r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n3.36m x 2.65m\r\n•\tTiled walls \r\n•\tFitted wall and floor units \r\n•\tElectric oven \r\n•\tHob and extractor fan \r\n•\tAmple storage and workspace \r\n\r\nLanding\r\n5.98m x 1.07m\r\n•\tFitted carpet \r\n\r\nMain Bedroom\r\n3.91m x 3.05m\r\n•\tTimber Floor\r\n•\tBuilt-in wardrobes \r\n\r\nEnsuite\r\n2.13m x 1.59m\r\n•\tFully tiled walls \r\n•\tWC \r\n•\tWash hand basin \r\n•\tPower shower \r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n4.17m x 3.03m\r\n•\tFitted carpet \r\n•\tBuilt-in slide robes \r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n3.58m x 3.46m\r\n•\tFitted carpet \r\n•\tBuilt-in slide robes \r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n2.12m x 1.73m\r\n•\tTiled floor \r\n•\tTiled bath surround \r\n•\tWC \r\n•\tWash hand basin \r\n•\tBath \r\n________________________________________"
      },
